[{"_1":2,"_3":4},"root",{"_5":183},"routes/guides.$slug",{"_5":6},"data",{"_7":8},"guide",{"_9":10,"_11":12,"_13":14,"_15":16,"_17":18,"_19":20,"_21":22,"_23":24,"_25":26,"_27":28,"_29":30},"title","Long Distance Gifts for Boyfriend: 12 Ideas to Feel Close From Miles Away","slug","long-distance-gifts-for-boyfriend","category","long-distance","seoTitle","Long Distance Gifts for Boyfriend: 12 Ideas to Feel Close (2026)","metaDescription","12 long distance gifts for your boyfriend: touch bracelets, love note messengers, care packages and video date games that make the miles feel smaller.","image","https://images.pexels.com/photos/6415625/pexels-photo-6415625.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=1216&h=912&fit=crop","imageAlt","A couple on a video call in a long distance relationship","intro","He is 3 time zones away, your calls keep dropping, and you just want to hug him. Long distance is hard, but the right gift makes him feel you are right there. We picked gifts guys actually like: tech that connects you, things he can hold, food he will love and games for your video calls. Our top pick: the TOTWOO touch bracelets. You tap yours, his lights up, wherever he is. Shipping tip: if he lives in another country, order 3 weeks early.","sections",[84,85,86,87,88],"comparison",{"_45":46,"_47":48},"faq",[31,32,33,34],{"_35":43,"_37":44},{"_35":41,"_37":42},{"_35":39,"_37":40},{"_35":36,"_37":38},"question","How early should I send a long distance gift?","answer","2 to 3 weeks early for international shipping, and even earlier in December. Use Amazon's gift options to ship it straight to his address.","Do long distance touch bracelets work in different countries?","Yes. They connect through an app over the internet, so the distance does not matter. Check that both phones are supported before you buy.","What do you put in a long distance care package for him?","His favorite snacks, coffee pods, a handwritten letter, a photo keychain, and something that smells like you, like a pillow cover sprayed with your perfume.","What should I get my long distance boyfriend?","Something he uses every day that reminds him of you: touch bracelets, a Lovebox, or a mug with a message. Add a care package for a nice surprise.","columns",[81,82,83],"rows",[49,50,51,52,53,54],{"_55":77,"_57":78},{"_55":73,"_57":74},{"_55":69,"_57":70},{"_55":65,"_57":66},{"_55":61,"_57":62},{"_55":56,"_57":58},"label","Open When envelopes","values",[59,60],"Hard days","When he needs it","Conversation cards",[63,64],"Video dates","Every call","Snack box",[67,68],"Care packages","All week","Hug This Pillow",[71,72],"Missing you at night","Every night","Lovebox",[75,76],"Surprise messages","Every week","Touch bracelets",[79,80],"Feeling close daily","Every day","Gift","Best for","He will use it",{"_89":162,"_91":163,"_93":164},{"_89":135,"_91":136,"_93":137},{"_89":120,"_91":121,"_93":122},{"_89":105,"_91":106,"_93":107},{"_89":90,"_91":92,"_93":94},"heading","Until you see him again","text","The hardest part is the waiting. This one makes the wait a little sweeter.","products",[95],{"_96":97,"_19":98,"_99":100,"_101":102,"_103":104},"name","Best for the hard days: Open When envelopes","https://images.pexels.com/photos/10131190/pexels-photo-10131190.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=600&h=600&fit=crop","alt","Man reading letters","description","20 envelopes labeled \"open when you miss me\", \"open when you can't sleep\" and more. Fill them with notes and photos, and mail them in one box. 4.7 stars.","amazonUrl","https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BTNJQ9VD?tag=relations0237-20","Turn video calls into real dates","\"So... what did you do today?\" Not again. These games give your calls something to do, and you will laugh more than you have in weeks.",[108,109],{"_96":115,"_19":116,"_99":117,"_101":118,"_103":119},{"_96":110,"_19":111,"_99":112,"_101":113,"_103":114},"Most fun: The Ultimate Date Night Game (Would You Rather?)","https://images.pexels.com/photos/3692738/pexels-photo-3692738.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=600&h=600&fit=crop","Couple laughing together","Silly, spicy and deep would-you-rather questions. You read one, he answers, and suddenly it is 2am. Over 800 reviews.","https://www.amazon.com/dp/0593435729?tag=relations0237-20","Best for video dates: 200 couples conversation cards","https://images.pexels.com/photos/4008457/pexels-photo-4008457.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=600&h=600&fit=crop","Man on a video call on his phone","200 questions made for couples, and they work great long distance. Pick a card on your call and get answers you never heard before. Over 2,400 reviews.","https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0875MVRK3?tag=relations0237-20","Care packages he will actually eat","Food is love, especially from far away. Add a handwritten note and the hoodie you stole from him, and it becomes a hug in a box.",[123,124],{"_96":130,"_19":131,"_99":132,"_101":133,"_103":134},{"_96":125,"_19":126,"_99":127,"_101":128,"_103":129},"For the coffee guy: Two Rivers flavored coffee pods","https://images.pexels.com/photos/4226867/pexels-photo-4226867.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=600&h=600&fit=crop","Coffee pods for a coffee machine","40 coffee pods in different flavors for his Keurig. A new flavor every morning, and a new reason to text you \"thank you.\" Over 61,000 reviews.","https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00N0JIACS?tag=relations0237-20","Best care package: healthy snack box (52 count)","https://images.pexels.com/photos/5056620/pexels-photo-5056620.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=600&h=600&fit=crop","Box of snacks and cookies","52 snacks in one big mix, ready to ship straight to his door. Over 1,000 reviews. Perfect for exam season or a busy week at work.","https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0H9TZZX3C?tag=relations0237-20","A piece of you he can hold","When he misses you, he needs something real, not a screen. These are small things that stay with him every day.",[138,139,140,141],{"_96":157,"_19":158,"_99":159,"_101":160,"_103":161},{"_96":152,"_19":153,"_99":154,"_101":155,"_103":156},{"_96":147,"_19":148,"_99":149,"_101":150,"_103":151},{"_96":142,"_19":143,"_99":144,"_101":145,"_103":146},"Best DIY gift: clear photo keychain","https://images.pexels.com/photos/7235902/pexels-photo-7235902.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=600&h=600&fit=crop","Polaroid photos and a passport","Pop in your favorite photo of the two of you, and he carries it everywhere. Costs little, and has over 1,200 reviews.","https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07T4SN46Q?tag=relations0237-20","Best for mornings: \"Distance means so little\" mug","https://images.pexels.com/photos/5332520/pexels-photo-5332520.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=600&h=600&fit=crop","Man drinking coffee at sunrise","A mug that says \"distance means so little when someone means so much.\" He drinks his morning coffee and thinks of you. 4.8 stars from over 500 buyers.","https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Z1H8C22?tag=relations0237-20","Best for his keys: matching puzzle keychains","https://images.pexels.com/photos/9227483/pexels-photo-9227483.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=600&h=600&fit=crop","Heart-shaped puzzle pieces","Two puzzle pieces that fit together, one for you and one for him. A tiny daily reminder that you are two halves of the same thing.","https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07BNG9Q7L?tag=relations0237-20","Sweetest pick: Hug This Pillow pillow cover","https://images.pexels.com/photos/8264246/pexels-photo-8264246.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=600&h=600&fit=crop","Person holding a soft white pillow","\"Hug this pillow until you can hug me.\" Spray it with your perfume before you mail it, and you will get a very happy call. Over 1,000 reviews. Good to know: it is the cover only, so add a pillow insert.","https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09LL9PV28?tag=relations0237-20","Tech that keeps you connected","Guys love a gadget, and these gadgets come with a little \"I miss you\" built in. One tap or one message, and he knows you are thinking of him.",[165,166,167],{"_96":178,"_19":179,"_99":180,"_101":181,"_103":182},{"_96":173,"_19":174,"_99":175,"_101":176,"_103":177},{"_96":168,"_19":169,"_99":170,"_101":171,"_103":172},"Best for his nightstand: LuvLink friendship lamps","https://images.pexels.com/photos/35392792/pexels-photo-35392792.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=600&h=600&fit=crop","Two glowing lamps connected across the distance","Two Wi-Fi lamps, one for each of you. Touch yours and his glows in your color, so he gets a soft \"goodnight\" from you every evening, even across time zones.","https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C5WVGVF4?tag=relations0237-20","Most romantic: Lovebox love note messenger","https://images.pexels.com/photos/6795725/pexels-photo-6795725.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=600&h=600&fit=crop","I love you written on a yellow heart","A little wooden box with a heart on top. Send a message from your phone, and the heart spins until he opens it and reads your note. Nearly 500 reviews.","https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0914RRGR2?tag=relations0237-20","Top pick: TOTWOO Sun and Moon touch bracelets","https://images.pexels.com/photos/34303810/pexels-photo-34303810.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=600&h=600&fit=crop","Couple holding hands outdoors","Tap your bracelet and his lights up and vibrates, anywhere in the world. Simple, not too flashy, and he can wear it to work. Good to know: it connects through a phone app, so check both phones are supported.","https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0DHRVYQK8?tag=relations0237-20",{"_184":185},"origin","https://relationshipgoals.store"]
